            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "You can now use `diagnostic.displayByVimDiagnostic`, enable this configuration will set diagnostics to nvim's `vim.diagnostic` that mini.nvim can request to use in Pick or statusline etc. ",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">You can now use <code class=\"notranslate\">diagnostic.displayByVimDiagnostic</code>, enable this configuration will set diagnostics to nvim's <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.diagnostic</code> that mini.nvim can request to use in Pick or statusline etc.</p>",
            "bodyText": "You can now use diagnostic.displayByVimDiagnostic, enable this configuration will set diagnostics to nvim's vim.diagnostic that mini.nvim can request to use in Pick or statusline etc.",
